  {
   "id": "bossgame-the-final-boss-is-my-heart-142558@1.1.7",
   "gameId": "bossgame-the-final-boss-is-my-heart-142558",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.7",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-07-29T18:51:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "BOSSGAME has been updated to version 1.1.7!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PATCH NOTES",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-----------------",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where remapped controls would be lost on reboot.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are still some issues I want to fix with controller support, such as controllers on Mac being a bit unreliable, and adding support for Nintendo Pro Controllers if possible. You may run into issues if your controller is not plugged in on game boot, or if you switch controllers mid-game. If you had remapped controls before this patch, you may have to reset them and remap again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If your keybinds break for some reason, you can reset them from the rebind screen, or by going to the title screen and pressing the \"P\" key on your keyboard 12 times.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "If you run into issues with remapping your specific controller, and the in-game remapping isn't robust enough, try resetting the in-game rebinds and using Steam Input to rebind. This can be found by right-clicking Bossgame in the library, going to Properties, and then Controller. This can be a workaround for some types of unsupported controllers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for understanding! Please have a nice weekend :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lily",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
